                "description": "Heavy Duty Coat and Hat Hook Deltana CAHH35 - Made of solid brass this heavy duty wall hook features 4 screw mounting holes for extra holding power. It has double hook arms for hanging both your coat and hat. Also used in bathrooms for hanging belts,  robes, coats or towels. It can mounted to your wall or the inside of closet doors. Easy to install with the included mounting hardware.",
